e-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:15.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct outside-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; left:calc(15.0000% + 5px); display:inline-block;\">15%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.1500\" title=\"Energy\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Energy <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Electrified Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_Big_b60abe.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:15.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct outside-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; left:calc(15.0000% + 5px); display:inline-block;\">15%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.1500\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:15.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct outside-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; left:calc(15.0000% + 5px); display:inline-block;\">15%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.1500\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:15.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct outside-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; left:calc(15.0000% + 5px); display:inline-block;\">15%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Second floor of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Underground%20Glooth%20Factory\">Underground Glooth Factory</a>, south side.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tIt will attack someone that is in its melee range. A glooth bomb never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tGather a team of 10 or more players to kill it. It's strong to all damage types, so use your best weapons and spells on it. Be careful with the other creatures around, specially if there's a raid happening. Watch out for the <a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Battery\">Glooth Batteries</a> as their area spell can cause quite a lot of damage.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</s